                  R1Z.PV_DL_CompressionTrace.run R1Z.PV_RDB2F_ConcreteSoft.software (List.map (fun b => ↑b) tail)
                    next)))))
        ((Aeneas.Std.bind_eq_iff (PV_CBL_ShaBytes.sha_load64 block)
